# 8. Tool design

Tools should be narrow, typed, permission-checked, and idempotent.

## Customer and memory tools

```text
get_customer_context(customer_id)
get_relevant_memory(customer_id, query, limit)
record_customer_preference(customer_id, preference, source, confidence)
correct_customer_memory(customer_id, memory_id, correction)
delete_customer_memory(customer_id, scope)
record_customer_feedback(customer_id, recommendation_id, feedback)
```

The model may request a memory write, but the backend should decide whether it is explicit enough to store.

## Restaurant and menu tools

```text
search_restaurants(query, village, language)
get_live_menu(restaurant_id)
validate_item(item_id, village, requested_time)
get_delivery_quote(restaurant_id, village, cart)
```

## Cart and order tools

```text
prepare_cart(customer_id, items, campaign_id)
reprice_cart(cart_id)
validate_cart(cart_id)
request_order_confirmation(cart_id)
create_order(cart_id, idempotency_key)
get_order_status(order_id)
```

## Campaign tools

```text
get_campaign_eligible_audience(restaurant_id, objective, filters)
get_campaign_offer_candidates(restaurant_id, objective)
validate_campaign_offer(restaurant_id, offer)
get_campaign_quote(restaurant_id, audience_id, offer_id)
validate_campaign_template(template_id)
check_portfolio_quota()
create_campaign_draft(input)
request_campaign_confirmation(campaign_id)
start_campaign_test_batch(campaign_id)
pause_campaign(campaign_id, reason)
get_campaign_report(campaign_id)
```

## Consent tools

```text
get_marketing_consent(customer_id, restaurant_id)
record_marketing_opt_in(customer_id, restaurant_id, source, version)
record_restaurant_mute(customer_id, restaurant_id)
record_global_opt_out(customer_id, source)
check_send_eligibility(customer_id, restaurant_id, campaign_id)
```

The send worker must call `check_send_eligibility` immediately before delivery, even if the campaign was previously approved.

