# 9. Personalized recommendation tool

The model should not rank raw menu rows itself. Call a deterministic recommendation service.

## Request

```json
{
  "customer_id": "cust_123",
  "restaurant_id": "vendor_456",
  "campaign_id": "camp_789",
  "objective": "reactivate_inactive_customer",
  "context": {
    "current_language": "ar-LB",
    "current_village": "Baakline",
    "current_time_beirut": "2026-10-09T17:30:00+03:00",
    "explicit_constraints": ["no spicy food"]
  },
  "candidate_scope": "approved_campaign_items",
  "limit": 3
}
```

## Response

```json
{
  "ranker_version": "broadcast_ranker_v1",
  "recommendations": [
    {
      "item_id": "item_123",
      "display_name": "Family Shawarma Meal",
      "verified_price_usd": 24.0,
      "verified_price_lbp": 2148000,
      "available": true,
      "eligible": true,
      "reasons": [
        "ordered_similar_item_21_days_ago",
        "matches_customer_price_range",
        "available_in_village",
        "valid_campaign_offer"
      ],
      "safety_notes": [],
      "expires_at": "2026-10-09T18:00:00+03:00"
    }
  ],
  "fallback": null
}
```

The model can turn these verified results into natural language, but must not modify the price, reasons, eligibility, or expiry.

