# 12. Confirmation gates

Use explicit confirmation whenever the model could cause an external side effect.

## Customer order

Show:

```text
Restaurant
Items
Modifiers
Delivery location
Delivery fee
Total in USD and LBP
Estimated timing
Payment method
```

Then require a button such as:

```text
Confirm order
```

## Merchant campaign

Show:

```text
Campaign objective
Restaurant
Offer
Exact message
Language
Eligible audience count
Test-batch size
Total estimated cost
Price in USD and LBP
Send time
Validity
Exclusions
```

Then require:

```text
Confirm and pay
```

A model-generated “yes” should not be treated as confirmation unless it is tied to a clear confirmation state and an approved action token.

