# 14. Model routing strategy

Use different model tiers by task.

| Task | Model strategy |
|---|---|
| STOP/opt-out detection | Deterministic keyword and button handling first |
| Simple routing | Fast, low-cost model or rules |
| Order extraction | Structured-output capable model |
| Complex Lebanese Arabic | Stronger model with evaluation coverage |
| Campaign copy | Strong model with strict schema and moderation |
| Recommendation ranking | Backend ranker, not an LLM |
| Allergen safety | Deterministic filters plus human escalation |
| Complaint/dispute | Strong model plus human handoff |
| Merchant campaign approval | Model assists; backend and owner confirm |

Do not use the most expensive model for every WhatsApp turn. Spend model budget where ambiguity, language complexity, or customer value justify it.

