# 16. Additional advice and warnings

## A. Build a workflow engine, not a chatbot demo

WhatsApp ordering includes durable states, retries, payment callbacks, delivery events, and confirmations. Use a state machine and idempotent commands. The LLM should not be the database for workflow state.

## B. Do not personalize too aggressively

Customers should feel understood, not surveilled. Say “your usual choice” only when it helps. Never expose exact purchase-frequency calculations or hidden profile attributes.

## C. Protect the shared number

Restaurant campaigns use Alo King’s reputation and WhatsApp quality rating. One bad restaurant campaign can damage every restaurant. Maintain merchant-level quality scores and suspend poor senders automatically.

## D. Keep sponsored discovery separate from personalized organic recommendations

A paid campaign should not silently influence organic recommendation ranking. If sponsored placement is shown inside an in-session list, label it clearly and keep it out of allergy, complaint, checkout, and order-status flows.

## E. Use real holdouts

Without a holdout group, a campaign may claim credit for customers who would have ordered anyway. Measure incremental completed orders, not just replies or clicks.

## F. Add a human operations console

Human review is needed for:

- campaign content disputes;
- repeated complaints;
- payment issues;
- allergy or safety incidents;
- delivery disputes;
- merchants whose campaigns damage quality;
- model uncertainty and repeated failures.

## G. Test failure paths before growth

Before opening campaigns to restaurants, simulate:

- customer opts out between audience creation and send;
- menu price changes after campaign approval;
- item sells out;
- template becomes paused;
- Meta returns 131049;
- duplicate webhook delivery;
- payment webhook retry;
- campaign is paused mid-send;
- AI provider timeout;
- merchant loses WhatsApp ownership;
- customer replies in Lebanese Arabic voice note.

## H. Measure cost per resolved conversation

From October 2026, service-message charges and campaign replies can affect margins. Track:

```text
Meta delivery cost
+ service-reply cost
+ AI cost
+ payment cost
+ support cost
+ discount cost
```

A campaign is not profitable merely because the initial marketing template was inexpensive.

